  "2026-07-26T12:46:39.716Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-07-26: searched every status for service override payload identity, claimed/handled reference equality, silent override no-op, and pass-through warnings. Closed pm-miqm owns invocation helpers and pm-5teq owns global output override diagnostics, but neither owns the same-reference claiming semantic; this is the canonical GH-741 child."
